		(property "Notes" "TPD4S201 VBIAS (ESD support), 0.1 uF 50 V X7R. The part's own clamps hold VBIAS to about 28 V (-Q1 6.3.1); the >= 63 V footnote is about capacitance loss, and 50 V X7R keeps more than the 0.04 uF effective minimum. TI's EVM uses 50 V (review 4 C-1/C-13)"
